        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    roe_values = [0.12, 0.131, 0.1055, 0.112, 0.1205]\n    total_assets = 2100  # million\n    total_liabilities = 1200  # million\n    preferred_equity = 120  # million\n    common_shares = 32  # million\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    average_roe = sum(roe_values) / len(roe_values)\n    common_equity = total_assets - total_liabilities - preferred_equity\n    normalized_eps = average_roe * common_equity / common_shares\n\n    # Return answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(normalized_eps, 3)\n```",
